 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "May the Congressman Protect You"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "의원님이 보우하사"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "A fantastic duo of a political master and a complete novice!\n\nI’m Gu Yeongjin, a six-term congressman — the pinnacle of South Korea’s political world, the nation’s hope!\nOne fateful day in 2008, betrayed by my closest aides, I faced a special investigation and chose to end my own life.\nWhen I opened my eyes… it was Seoul, 10 years in the past?!\n\nNow a ghost, no one can see me or hear my voice.\nNo one... except one person, Cha Jaerim, a 25-year-old Level 9 civil servant.\n\nNo connections, no money, stuck in miserable circumstances...\nBut look at that ambition, that fire in his eyes... I like it! Fine. I’ll make him my partner.\n\n“You need to go into politics.”\n\nAnd I’ll get my revenge.\n\nA political genius ghost, Gu Yeongjin, teams up with a clueless rookie, Cha Jaerim, for the ultimate combo in\n\u003cMay the Congressman Protect You\u003e"
  },
